1
00:00:01,179 --> 00:00:02,909
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:02,914 --> 00:00:04,524
I guess I'm still wondering

3
00:00:04,529 --> 00:00:06,399
if Emily and I
are right for each other.

4
00:00:06,397 --> 00:00:08,767
Does this have to do with
that girl you had coffee with?

5
00:00:08,766 --> 00:00:11,766
You mean the strong, sexy angel
I can't stop thinking about?

6
00:00:11,769 --> 00:00:14,099
Who can say?

7
00:00:14,105 --> 00:00:17,235
I need to come up with
a big idea to make some money.

8
00:00:17,241 --> 00:00:19,211
There's no reason you can't.
That's easy for you to say.

9
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:20,640
You and Sheldon already came up

10
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:22,445
with your
superfluid helium model.

11
00:00:22,447 --> 00:00:23,647
That's just research.

12
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:25,418
We're never going
to make any money from it.

13
00:00:25,416 --> 00:00:27,386
Forget helium...
the real superfluid

14
00:00:27,385 --> 00:00:29,615
is the fruit punch in this mug.

15
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,720
It reminds me of my daddy's
secret “Don't Tell Mama” juice.

16
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,630
Maybe that's an idea.

17
00:00:36,627 --> 00:00:39,357
Guidance systems
for drunk people.

18
00:00:39,363 --> 00:00:41,533
They have that,
it's called Uber.

19
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:44,797
Hey, in your supercooled
helium experiments,

20
00:00:44,802 --> 00:00:47,232
did you create
quantum vortices?

21
00:00:47,238 --> 00:00:48,238
Yeah, why?

22
00:00:48,239 --> 00:00:49,669
Well, if you made
a guidance system,

23
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:52,004
couldn't you use those vortices
as a gyroscope?

24
00:00:52,009 --> 00:00:54,439
Wow. Never thought about that.

25
00:00:54,445 --> 00:00:56,215
And, since it's
in a quantum state,

26
00:00:56,214 --> 00:00:57,714
it would maintain
an infinite persistence.

27
00:00:57,715 --> 00:00:58,885
Groundbreaking
revelations,

28
00:00:58,883 --> 00:01:00,453
tropical drinks.

29
00:01:00,451 --> 00:01:10,031
Tell me this isn't like the best
episode of Sex and the City.

